---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
        <title>Resurfacing Solutions</title>
    </head>

    <body class="bg-brand-white">
        <main class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-10">

            <div class="max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-brand-gray-light bg-brand-white p-12 shadow-lg">

                <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-red">
                    Tailwind CSS 4 ✔
                </p>

                <h1 class="mb-6 text-6xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal font-primary">
                    Resurfacing
                    <span class="font-secondary italic text-brand-red">
                        Solutions
                    </span>
                </h1>

                <p class="mb-10 max-w-2xl text-lg text-brand-gray">
                    Si estás viendo esta pantalla correctamente significa que
                    Astro está leyendo Tailwind CSS 4, el archivo global.css y
                    los colores definidos en <strong>@theme</strong>.
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-red p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-white">
                        RED
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-charcoal p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-white">
                        CHARCOAL
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-dark p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-white">
                        DARK
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-black p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-white">
                        BLACK
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-gray p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-white">
                        GRAY
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-gray-medium p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-charcoal">
                        MEDIUM
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-gray-light p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-charcoal">
                        LIGHT
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-lg bg-brand-blue p-6 text-center font-semibold text-brand-white">
                        BLUE
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </main>
    </body>
</html>